# The connected UI needs no environment variables today. It reads the committed
# case study at build time and contacts public structure databases (UniProt,
# RCSB PDB, AlphaFold DB) directly from the browser with identifiers only.
#
# A future Python backend adapter (see src/data/adapters/ApiDataSource.contract.md)
# would introduce one:
#
# VITE_CAPSTONE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example/api/v1
